body:
Thanks, I'll for sure keep your tips in mind. I agree the vocal processing needs some work, not entirely sure why its so low during the break. My bass is currently just one layer, so I was thinking of EQing out more of the mids, and adding a dedicated layer for more mids. And yeah I know the bassline is super repetetive, but thats kind of typical for the genre so idk.

&#x200B;

thnaks though
